"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years. In 2025 the middle sat at 23% of normal for February to March and 158% for June to July. Grid 19628 had its driest year in 1956, at 44% of normal.</p>"}
